# Sigarda's Aid says "you may cast", so it is only Bot1 who may cast Equipment spells as though they had flash. Bot2, with
# the mana for Lightning Greaves in Bot1's main phase, is not offered it there; in Bot2's own main phase it casts it as the
# sorcery-speed artifact it is, the positive control.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Sigarda's Aid
Forest x18

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Lightning Greaves
Island x17

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Sigarda's Aid.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Pass
! Bot2.Hand.Lightning Greaves.Cast
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Greaves.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T4 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield = Mox Jet; Mox Ruby; Lightning Greaves
